{"ref":"BDB, אַ֫יִל⁴","hw":"אַ֫יִל⁴","html":"† IV. <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">אַ֫יִל</span> ?]</big>  <strong>n.m. terebinth (</strong>prob. as prominent, lofty tree, v. Di <a data-ref=\"Genesis 12:6\" href=\"/Genesis.12.6\">Gn 12:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 14:6\" href=\"/Genesis.14.6\">14:6</a><strong>)</strong>—cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵיל</span> only n.pr. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵיל פָּארָן</span> vid. infr.; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵילִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 1:29\" href=\"/Isaiah.1.29\">Is 1:29</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵלִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 57:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.57.5\">Is 57:5</a> cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵילֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 61:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.61.3\">Is 61:3</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵלֵיהֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 31:14\" href=\"/Ezekiel.31.14\">Ez 31:14</a> (> del. Co vid. 𝔙 𝔄).—<em>terebinth</em> (cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, אֵלָה\" href=\"/BDB,_אֵלָה\", dir=\"rtl\">אֵלָה</a>); as marking idol-shrines <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 1:29\" href=\"/Isaiah.1.29\">Is 1:29</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 57:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.57.5\">57:5</a> (so Che Di etc. > <em>gods</em>); fig. of ransomed ones of Zion <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵילֵי הַצֶּדֶק</span>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 61:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.61.3\">61:3</a>; perhaps of haughty ones <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 31:14\" href=\"/Ezekiel.31.14\">Ez 31:14</a>.","next":"BDB, אֵיל פָּארָן","prev":"BDB, אַ֫יִל³"}